| 4. The job no guild will record | [S2E04](../delvers/episodes/S2E04.md)–[S2E05](../delvers/episodes/S2E05.md) | Shrugs, four guardians, completed burglary and escape, loot settlement, withheld shares and investigative objects; preserve the jade-count discrepancy in notes |
