| 6. The mountain of fire | [S2E08](../delvers/episodes/S2E08.md), opening of [S2E09](../delvers/episodes/S2E09.md) | Marsh, Skoogie, dragon equipment and confrontation; dragon victory is supplied by the next episode's retrospective narration, not fully performed combat in the earlier episode |
