The final expedition is split into gate/preparation and finale chapters. The preserved 13,724-word body becomes 3,802 words including introduction and epilogue; the last main chapter remains slightly fuller at 480 words. The [checkpoint](../reports/DELVERS_SEASON_THREE_CONSOLIDATION_2026-10-26.md) records paragraph-level dispositions and distinguishes visions from the physical rescue and collapse.

## Next acceptance work

All three primary arcs have preserved consolidation checkpoints. The [four world pilots](../reports/DELVERS_WORLD_PILOTS_2026-10-26.md) are also complete within their stated evidence limits. [Evelyn and Krandal](../reports/DELVERS_EVELYN_KRANDAL_2026-10-26.md) now complete the core-PC character batch. Next examine connected family/mentor pages and guild subjects in small linked batches. Establish each actual researched horizon and last direct observation, preserve its pre-edit bytes and check its domain contract. Neither narrative consolidation nor the pilots certify every remaining world article or close unresolved source questions.
